---
title: Sequence Diagram - suspicious transaction, verification and fraud review
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant UI as React front end
    participant TS as TransactionService
    participant FR as FraudRiskService
    participant NS as NotificationService
    participant AS as AuditService
    participant DB as Database
    actor A as Fraud Analyst
    participant FCS as FraudCaseService

    C->>UI: Submit a large transfer
    UI->>TS: POST /api/transactions/transfer
    TS->>TS: Validation passes
    TS->>FR: evaluate(account, beneficiary, amount, now)
    FR-->>TS: score and level

    alt MEDIUM risk (score 30 to 59)
        rect rgb(253, 243, 226)
            TS->>DB: Save transaction, status PENDING_VERIFICATION
            TS->>DB: Insert FraudAlert (status OPEN)
            TS->>TS: Generate a six digit code
            TS->>DB: Insert VerificationRequest storing only the BCrypt hash
            TS->>AS: FRAUD_ALERT_RAISED, VERIFICATION_REQUESTED
            TS->>NS: Deliver the code through the notification module
            NS->>DB: Insert notification
            TS-->>UI: 201 PENDING_VERIFICATION, verificationRequired = true
        end
        UI->>C: Show the verification form
        C->>UI: Read the code on the Notifications page and enter it
        UI->>TS: POST /api/transactions/{ref}/verify
        TS->>DB: Load the pending verification request
        alt Code correct and not expired
            TS->>AS: VERIFICATION_SUCCESS
            TS->>DB: Debit and credit, status APPROVED, close the alert
            TS->>NS: "Transfer completed"
            TS-->>UI: 200 APPROVED
        else Wrong code, attempts remaining
            TS->>AS: VERIFICATION_FAILED
            TS-->>UI: 422 INVALID_VERIFICATION_CODE with attempts left
        else All 3 attempts used, or the code expired
            TS->>DB: status BLOCKED, verification FAILED
            TS->>DB: Escalate the alert to a new FraudCase
            TS->>AS: TRANSACTION_BLOCKED, FRAUD_CASE_OPENED
            TS->>NS: "Transfer blocked"
            TS-->>UI: 422 VERIFICATION_FAILED
        end

    else HIGH risk (score 60 and above)
        rect rgb(251, 236, 235)
            TS->>DB: Save transaction, status PENDING (held)
            TS->>DB: Insert FraudAlert (status UNDER_REVIEW)
            TS->>DB: Insert FraudCase (status OPEN)
            TS->>AS: FRAUD_ALERT_RAISED, FRAUD_CASE_OPENED
            TS->>NS: "Transfer held for review"
            TS-->>UI: 201 PENDING
        end
        UI->>C: Explain that the transfer is being reviewed

        A->>FCS: GET /api/fraud-cases
        FCS-->>A: Open cases with the reason each was flagged
        A->>FCS: POST /api/fraud-cases/{ref}/assign
        FCS->>DB: status UNDER_REVIEW, assigned to the analyst
        A->>FCS: POST /api/fraud-cases/{ref}/decision + remarks
        alt Analyst approves
            FCS->>TS: releaseAfterReview(...)
            TS->>DB: Debit and credit, status APPROVED
            FCS->>DB: case RESOLVED_APPROVED, alert CLOSED
            TS->>NS: "Transfer completed"
        else Analyst blocks
            FCS->>TS: blockAfterReview(...)
            TS->>DB: status BLOCKED, no money moved
            FCS->>DB: case RESOLVED_BLOCKED, alert CLOSED
            TS->>NS: "Transfer blocked"
        end
        FCS->>AS: FRAUD_CASE_DECIDED (who decided, and why)
        FCS-->>A: 200 with the final case and transaction status
    end
